 75CU2c  Phys Rev C 84, 034320 (2011)                                           
 75CU c  Compiled by B. Singh (McMaster), September 30, 2011                    
 75CU c  {+75}Cu was produced at ISOLDE-CERN facility by 1.4 GeV proton induced 
 75CU2c  fission of uranium carbide target. In-source laser spectroscopy.       
 75CU3c  Measured hyperfine structure. Deduced spins and magnetic dipole moment 
 75CU4c  of the ground state. Collinear and in-source laser spectroscopic       
 75CU5c  technique. Comparison with large-scale shell-model calculations using  
 75CU6c  {+56}Ni core.                                                          
