 75ZN c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2026Mu04:                          
 75ZN c  Phys Rev C 113, 044321 (2026)                                          
 75ZN c  Compiled by E.A. McCutchan (NNDC,BNL) June 6, 2026                     
 75ZN c  {+75}Cu beam produced from neutron-induced fission of {+238}U          
 75ZN2c  (using UC{-x} target). Neutrons produced by bombarding a tungsten      
 75ZN3c  spallation target with 1.4 GeV protons. Cu ions separated with         
 75ZN4c  a high resolution separator (HRS) of ISOLDE. {+75}Cu delivered         
 75ZN5c  to the ISOLTRAP setup where measurements of time-of-flight             
 75ZN6c  ion-cyclotron-resonance were performed. Deduced excitation energy      
 75ZN7c  of isomer.                                                             
 75ZN cL J$As proposed by 2026Mu04                                              
