 75GA2c  Fragments diffused out of target and surface ionized, then accelerated 
 75GA3c  to 30 keV, followed by mass separation and bunched by gas-filled Paul  
 75GA4c  Trap (ISCOOL). Isotope shifts were measured by collinear laser         
