 75GE5c  {+76}Se(|a,{+3}He); {+78}Se({+3}He,|a); {+78}Se(|a,{+3}He). See        
 75GExc  relevant dataset for each reaction.                                    
 75GE c  Uncertainty in cross sections: statistical uncertainty of 1%           
 75GE2c  for strong peaks; systematic uncertainties of 5% in absolute values    
 75GE3c  and 3% in relative values.                                             
