 75AS cL E,J$ Unless otherwise noted, 2008KaZT take values from 'adopted levels,
 75AS2cL gammas' dataset for {+75}As in the ENSDF database                      
 75AS cL E(X)$ 265, 280 and 304 groups are unresolved, angle-to-angle ratios of 
 75AS2cL cross sections used to assign separate cross sections. The 304 peak    
 75AS3cL was probably analyzed by line-shape fitting procedure. See details     
 75AS4cL of the fitting procedures for unresolved peaks in 2008KaZT             
