 75AS6cL sets of optical-model potential parameters and two different           
 75AS7cL bound-state potential parameters were used for the calculations. See   
 75AS8cL 2008KaZT for listing of these parameters. Differences in (2J+1)C{+2}S  
 75AS9cL values were less than 10% for different sets of optical parameters     
 75ASAcL used. The effects of the bound-state parameters were also within the   
 75ASBcL uncertainties.                                                         
