 75RB c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2007Wy01:                          
 75RB2c  Phys Rev C 76, 011301(R) (2007)                                        
 75RB c  Compiled by S. Geraedts and B. Singh (McMaster) July 5, 2007           
 75RB c  E=165 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g using GAMMASPHERE and Microball     
 75RB2c  arrays. Rotational structures observed in {+75}Rb compared to those    
 75RB3c  observed in neighboring T{-z}=1/2 nucleus {+73}Kr. Total Routhian      
 75RB4c  calculations (TRS) with T=1 pairing for {+75}Rb and T=0 pairing        
 75RB5c  for {+73}Kr.                                                           
 75RB d  Details of data were requested by the compilers through e-mail to the  
 75RB2d  first author on July 2, 2007, but no response was received as of July 5
 75RB cL E$From least-squares fit to E|g's (by compilers), assuming an          
 75RB2cL uncertainty of 1 keV.                                                  
 75RB cL BAND(A)$ |p(fp), |a=-1/2.                                              
 75RB2cL Band built on Nilsson orbitals originating from |pp{-3/2} - |pf{-5/2}  
 75RB3cL pseudospin doublet.                                                    
 75RB cL BAND(a)$ |p(fp), |a=+1/2.                                              
 75RB2cL Band built on Nilsson orbitals originating from |pp{-3/2} - |pf{-5/2}  
 75RB3cL pseudospin doublet. The TRS calculations do not agree with a           
 75RB4cL 3-quasiparticle configuration at higher spins as observed in {+73}Kr.  
