 75RB c  Radioactive Rb atoms were produced at the ISAC, TRIUMF facility from   
 75RB2c  spallation of a stack of natural Nb foils irradiated by 500 MeV        
 75RB3c  protons TRIUMF cyclotron. Measured hyperfine structure, isotope shifts 
 75RB4c  using collinear laser spectroscopy method.                             
